The clause's trigger is a report that has no late shipments. None of the candidate situations matches it.

The shipment-lateness candidates (more than two days late, more than one day late, lost) are different conditions from "no late shipments", so each is false. The session, invoice, helper agent, approval, supplier and carrier candidates are unrelated to the clause.

