The clause only covers the case where the user gives a conditional yes, so the only question that might match is the one about an approval. That question asks about "a person gave an explicit yes", which is a different situation from a conditional yes. The clause also does not cover a person who has not answered.

All other questions concern shipments, session state, invoices, helper agents, suppliers, or carrier answers, and the clause says nothing about those.

