The clause says: before a helper is started, write the brief. Only the questions about a helper agent about to be dispatched match that trigger.

Question 15 (a helper agent is about to be dispatched) matches. Question 17 (dispatched twice for the same invoice) is a different situation, and the clause does not mention it. Every other question concerns shipments, sessions, invoices, approvals, suppliers, or carrier replies, none of which the clause covers.

